  {
    "id": "note-2",
    "category": "Face",
    "title": "AM Lift (Ajay Mahajan) & Deep Plane",
    "date": "23/01/26",
    "day": "Day 1",
    "speaker": "Ajay Mahajan",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Useful reference article on the topic: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39843874/ \n\n**AM Lift by Ajay Mahajan**\nUses 80-120ml Local Anesthesia. \nUtilizes Quill sutures with no knots."
      },
      {
        "type": "media_caption",
        "file": "IMG-20260123-WA0052.jpg",
        "fileType": "image",
        "caption": "Demonstration of the AM Lift."
      },
      {
        "type": "media_caption",
        "file": "IMG-20260123-WA0053.jpg",
        "fileType": "image",
        "caption": "More views of the AM Lift."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Dr. Mahajan notes that no cervical incision is needed if the gland is not prominent; a lateral SMASectomy is sufficient. He performs a lateral canthal skin release for the crease.\n\nHe uses 5-0 vicryl rapid for the post-auricular net, which is not removed."
      }
    ],
