  {
    "id": "note-5",
    "category": "Face",
    "title": "Chiara Botti - Electric Facelift",
    "date": "23/01/26",
    "day": "Day 1",
    "speaker": "",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "**Chiara Botti's Electric Facelift Technique**\n\nKey steps include:\n- Defatting the platysma.\n- Criss-cross platysma sutures (like a Z-plasty corset).\n- **All dissection is done with cautery.**\n- Defatting in front of the ear.\n- Marking the zygomatic bone and performing sub-SMAS dissection downwards.\n- Anchoring SMAS to the mastoid bone.\n- Addressing the periosteum of the zygomatic bone and orbital rim.\n- Uses Fibrin Glue."
      },
      {
        "type": "media_caption",
        "file": "IMG-20260123-WA0095.jpg",
        "fileType": "image",
        "caption": "3D Antera imaging used."
      }
    ],
    "gallery": [
      "IMG-20260123-WA0097.jpg"
    ],
