  {
    "id": "note-20",
    "category": "Breast",
    "title": "Abeer Abdulshakoor - Breast Lipofilling",
    "date": "24/01/26",
    "day": "Day 2",
    "speaker": "",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "**Abeer Abdulshakoor (Riyadh)**\n- Harvest: 3000rpm for 3 minutes. Max pressure -250mm Hg.\n- **Consent**: Warn about radiological changes and nodule formation (Coarse calcification vs Micro in CA).\n- **Contraindications**: Cancer in family, Smokers.\n- **Complications**: <1% (infection/nodule/hematoma).\n- **Technique**: Avoid intraglandular. Subcutaneous and Subglandular planes only.\n- Uses Suction Bra to increase vascularization.\n- **Endpoint**: Stop when it starts blanching.\n- For explantation + lipofilling: Get MRI first.\n- High IMF? Break down with cannula via periareolar approach.\n- Periareolar Pexy: Absorbable suture 1st stage, Prolene 2nd stage."
      },
      {
        "type": "media_caption",
        "file": "IMG-20260124-WA0019.jpg",
        "fileType": "image",
        "caption": "Double needle technique shown."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "PLLA lasts 24 months. Aptos barbs are sturdy and don't yield."
      }
