  {
    "id": "note-21",
    "category": "Breast",
    "title": "B-Lite Implants & Other Notes",
    "date": "24/01/26",
    "day": "Day 2",
    "speaker": "",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "**Saldanha HD Lipo**: Maintains 0.5-0.7mm fat layer (approx 1.5cm pinch).\n\n**B-Lite Implants**:\n- 30% lighter.\n- Silicone cohesive gel with air-filled borosilicate microspheres.\n- Coating is PU.\n- Normal implant ~1g/cc. B-lite ~0.7g/cc (300cc = 210g).\n- 90% Subglandular placement.\n- Simultaneous fat grafting in subcutaneous plane for upper pole fullness."
      }
