  {
    "id": "note-25",
    "category": "Injectables",
    "title": "Fillers & Skin Boosters (Dr. Sumit's Notes)",
    "date": "25/01/26",
    "day": "Day 3",
    "speaker": "Dr. Sumit's Notes",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "**Product Selection:**\n- Skin: Redensity 1 or 2\n- Midface: RHA 4\n- Periosteal: RHA 4 and Ultradensity\n\n**Chin:**\n- Pinch -> Hit bone -> 0.2ml (Perpendicular) -> 0.1ml Subcut.\n- Lower chin: Hit bone 0.2ml.\n- Total 0.5ml per side.\n\n**Temple:**\n- 0.6ml Deep Perpendicular.\n\n**Zygoma:**\n- 0.2 + 0.2ml Subcut.\n\n**Masseter:**\n- 0.3 + 0.3ml Subcut.\n\n**Gonial Angle:**\n- Edge + 1cm Anterior + 1cm Superior (Ramus) -> 0.2ml each point.\n\n**Protocol (D. Lorenzi):**\n- Aspiration: Long (6 seconds).\n- Mould high G' prime fillers **ON TABLE** (harder after 48h).\n- Always have Hyaluronidase.\n\n**Skin Boosters:**\n- 1.5 - 2ml per side.\n- Subcutaneous, retrograde injections.\n- Reach above lid-cheek junction.\n- Repeat: 3 months (Booster), 6 months (Filler).\n- Hydration time: Booster (7-10 days), Filler (3 weeks)."
      }
    ],
