  {
    "id": "note-26-0",
    "category": "Body",
    "title": "BBL Guidelines (Lina Triana)",
    "date": "25/01/26",
    "day": "Day 3",
    "speaker": "Lina Triana",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "**BBL Safety & Technique:**\n- **Completely avoid muscle** (Gluteal muscle lacks posterior fascia).\n- Always Prone position.\n- Fanning retrograde injections.\n- **Entry Points**: Supragluteal, Lateral Gluteal. **Avoid Infragluteal**.\n- **Volume**: 300-420cc per side.\n- **Saldanha Rule**: Strictly < 300cc.\n- **Resorption**: 40-50%.\n\n**Post-Op:**\n- Clexane 40mg (12h pre-op, then OD x 14 days).\n- Compression x 21 days.\n- Avoid hypothermia.\n- Intra-op compression pumps."
      }
    ],
