      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "**Dimple Creation Technique:**\n- Landmark: Stenson's duct (2nd upper molar).\n- 2.5ml 1% LA.\n- Exercise mucosa to deep dermis (4mm hole).\n- Suture: 3-0 Monocryl (railroad to skin). Dissolves in 3 weeks.\n- For sharper dimple: Use 3-0 PDS.\n- **Revision Rate**: 7% (mostly for deepening)."
      },
      {
        "type": "media_caption",
