        "content": "**Paraskevas Vakis Kontoes Techniques:**\n\n**Lower Bleph:**\n- Via upper bleph incision -> Submuscular dissection to lateral canthal ligament.\n- 6-0 Nylon to periosteum of orbital rim.\n\n**Canthopexy:**\n- Inferior slip alone of lateral canthal ligament.\n- Via small window through OOM to periosteum."
