    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "**Lina Triana - Vaginoplasty**\n\nDoes both anterior and posterior.\n- Anterior: For sexual gratification.\n- Technique: Cut mucosa -> Blunt dissection -> Preserve urethra (catheter in situ) -> Approximate fascia -> Cut excess mucosa -> Suture.\n- Posterior: Similar. Perineoplasty for muscle bites.\n\n**Labiaplasty:**\n- First, clitoral hood horseshoe incision.\n- Minora: Cut more internal side, less external side so the scar is hidden inside.\n- 3-point suture at top (clitoral hood + 2 edges of minora).\n- **How much to keep?** Tip of forceps to neck (approx 1cm minimum)."
      },
